flowchart LR
  subgraph P1[① Agent 工程劳动]
    direction TB
    START([维护者发起任务])
    ORC[起沙箱·领短时 token]
    READ[repo.read 判断技术栈]
    EDIT[写 Dockerfile 健康端点]
    BUILD{sandbox.build}
    FIX1[/失败：分析日志修代码/]
    START --> ORC --> READ --> EDIT --> BUILD
    FIX1 --> BUILD
  end
  subgraph P2[② 提案与 CI 自修]
    direction TB
    SUBMIT{proposal.submit 校验}
    PR[agent/ 分支 + PR]
    CI{Actions CI}
    FIX2[/失败：Webhook 唤醒·修复重提/]
    REJ[/被拒：调整 patch/]
    SUBMIT -->|通过| PR --> CI
    FIX2 --> CI
    SUBMIT -->|拒绝| REJ
  end
  subgraph P3[③ 人工审批与发布（Agent 无通道）]
    direction TB
    DONE[全绿：沙箱销毁 token 作废]
    REVIEW{维护者审查}
    MANUAL[/要求修改：人工反馈/]
    MERGE[批准合并 → digest 镜像]
    RELEASE[Environment 人工审批]
    DEPLOY[Deployer 蓝绿部署]
    LIVE([上线 · Agent 零凭据])
    DONE --> REVIEW
    REVIEW -->|批准| MERGE --> RELEASE --> DEPLOY --> LIVE
    REVIEW -->|要求修改| MANUAL
  end
  BUILD -->|失败| FIX1
  BUILD -->|成功| SUBMIT
  CI -->|失败| FIX2
  CI -->|全绿| DONE

  classDef success fill:#d9ead3,stroke:#38761d
  classDef failure fill:#f4cccc,stroke:#cc0000
  classDef human fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#bf9000
  class BUILD,CI success
  class FIX1,FIX2,REJ,MANUAL failure
  class REVIEW,RELEASE human
